Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've worked for a whole week straight...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, is it... Done?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We still have to burn the DVDs, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's basically done!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have done it without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:21.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You put in all the effort, Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:59.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,403.2)}{\an7}Time For Our First Event!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're going to an event tomorrow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:03.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you were up all night with him too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to process all this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you like to go with me, Mikari-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:09.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's gonna be way too many people there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything with him, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do what with who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,With Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.21,0:02:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, Ririsa, I hate that I have to ask this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:28.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the event with Ririsa.\NIn a way, it kinda feels like...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It kinda feels like a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.21,0:02:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just helping a fellow club member!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right, this is a club event!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like teammates going to a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:50.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what should I wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bet Ririsa's not even thinking about her outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:03:00.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,396)}{\an7}Akiba
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.83,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,223.2)}{\an7}Moe everyday
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,As a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. How do you feel about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.88,0:03:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, we've got a lot in common...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:12.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's helping me achieve my dreams,\Nand he's shy, but always so supportive...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:18.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is gonna make me sound like an otaku,\Nbut he's kind of like Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that basically mean you're into him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Crap, I shouldn't have said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:27.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.13,0:03:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, I have a crush on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.88,0:03:31.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That can't be right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What should I wear tomorrow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.75,0:03:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should I just go as Lilliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why am I so embarrassed about this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The event starts at 10,\Nbut since it's our first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,let's play it safe and take the earliest train!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get playing it safe,\Nbut we're way too early!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:55.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna kill four hours?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.83,0:04:00.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't look weird, right?\NI wonder what Ririsa's gonna wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Probably something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:03.79,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(652.8,367.2)}{\an7}Lilliel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.13,0:04:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Riri...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope you weren't waiting long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-is that really her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:19.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this the "girl takes off her glasses" cliché?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-is my outfit weird? I don't look awful, do I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:26.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, you look great, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were this fashionable...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What should I wear to the event with Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:36.88,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,511.2)}{\an7}what clothes do otaku like
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(665.6,309.6)}{\an7}Virgin-killer\N{\pos(704,360)}{\an7}outfits
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should I buy one? No, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You want me to put together\Nan outfit for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I don't figure something out,\NI'll end up buying the virgin-killer sweater!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,The virgin-killer what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where do you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:55.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's not too far from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come over early tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll show off your bust with a\Nboat neck and an off-the-shoulder top,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,and put a tank top underneath for a bit of a sexy vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.75,0:05:12.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You could go with palazzo pants,\Nbut he'll like a miniskirt with a long belt better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:15.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, and a cross-body bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:19.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's pretty hot for May so you can totally wear sandals,\Nwith heels, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:21.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you HAVE to wear contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:23.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-if she says so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.54,0:05:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you get up so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:32.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But you made me a costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.17,0:05:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I put together an outift! We're even now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But don't tell Senpai I helped you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-this was definitely too early to meet up...\NI'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:50.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, better to be too early than late.\NWe can go kill some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,He sounds so calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I was treating\Nthis like it was a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:57.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:06:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa's totally treating this like a date,\Ntoo, isn't she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:02.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're just two nerds going to a nerd event!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still, we're here together, all dressed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.25,0:06:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,We totally look like a couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa must be nervous for her first event.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need to break the silence...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait! What are the go-to topics\Nfor events in dating sims?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:22.21,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,309.6)}{\an7}We’ve got three hours...\N{\pos(140.8,360)}{\an7}What should we do?\N{\pos(115.2,482.4)}{\an7}You look cute today, Ririsa.\N{\pos(102.4,540)}{\an7}Nice weather today, huh?\N{\pos(102.4,597.6)}{\an7}What panties you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm glad it's nice out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:28.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The weather's always easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,All she can do is agree. It's foolproof!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if it's too sunny,\Nour photos will come out way too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:41.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's actually better for it to be\Ncloudy for outdoor photoshoots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:47.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can do better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:49.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've gotta take charge here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.75,0:06:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wanna go somewhere to hang for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sure, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.17,0:06:56.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.25,0:07:03.50,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,165.6)}{\an7}Crane Game\N{\pos(537.6,266.4)}{\an7}Special Campaign\N{\pos(550.4,316.8)}{\an7}First Play Free!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's still really early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's a karaoke place nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:07.29,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,115.2)}{\an7}KARAOKE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it just closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa looks upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:10.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.46,0:07:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've gotta turn things around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:14.29,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422.4,79.2)}{\an7}MANGA CAFÉ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No rooms available.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's check out the other side of the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe something's open over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my feet really hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:27.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You okay? Can I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never walked this much in heels before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why she looked upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I've been walking her all over the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I notice?! I'm such a dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.46,0:07:43.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,3D girls are way more complicated\Nthan dating sim characters!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I've ruined everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,And now she's looking at her phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't say I blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:07:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've gotta say something...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.79,0:08:08.00,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(665.6,424.8)}{\an7}Lilliel: Another World
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Want to watch the spinoff episode?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:07.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was busy getting ready so I missed it last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:13.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh, this episode is epic!\NI wish I could've seen it live!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,God, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to watch it with you, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:35.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, for not taking care of you, and now,\Nwe're just watching anime on a bench...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I always have fun with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know we'll have a good time\Nno matter where we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I wouldn't mind a\N3D girl if she was as cool as Ririsa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No no, stop that, we're just club friends, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.71,0:08:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what Ririsa meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.13,0:08:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, Ririsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:02.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's almost time for the event!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right!\NTime flies when you're watching anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this it? It's kinda small.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was expecting something massive like Comiket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:15.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(448,345.6)}{\an7}Photo Area
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-most cosplay-only events are like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-this is actually one of the larger ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm just nervous since it's my first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:33.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's see... Here's our booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.29,0:09:35.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll set up our gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:38.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Actually, we... kinda don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:43.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was so focused on finishing the ROM...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot to print out covers or a poster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:50.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are people going to buy these?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:54.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our neighbor is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:58.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her ROMs look so pretty,\Nand look at that big poster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:58.21,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,57.6)}{\an7}Lady Folosso
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then look at us...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,With our blank white DVD cases...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It looks so amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:09.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, "look, we burned them all one by one!" Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,At least I wrote the title on each DVD!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:16.79,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(998.4,302.4)}{\an7}LILLIEL\N{\pos(934.4,460.8)}{\an7}500 PICTURES
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:14.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now it looks like some black market stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:18.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Salutations, milady Magino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Behold, your booth is fully assembled!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.79,0:10:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hi, neighbors! I'm Magino.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:28.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow! You're Lady Folosso!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, nice to meet you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Folosso's from that huge mobile\Ngame that just came out in March!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,People are already cosplaying her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are your names? And what are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's our first time,\Nand we forgot a bunch of stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:50.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Newbies, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a Lilliel cosrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel?! That's so old!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh geez, sorry! I forgot the spinoff is still airing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:02.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But you won't get a lot of attention unless\Nyou're cosplaying current characters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.88,0:11:05.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or a lot of sales, if I do say so myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't be crass, Ogino.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:12.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone's first time always sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But cosroms are just business!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can make it work if you're a good saleswoman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's break a leg today!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.29,0:11:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you her photographer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:22.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You brought your costume, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you dressed up, they'd know what these are,\Nand we might sell some!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:35.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I was gonna try selling
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:37.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,these without getting into costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-there are just so many amazing\Ncosplayers around us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm worried I'm not as good as them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:50.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think I have the confidence.\NI'm too nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Lilliel is so much cuter than-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:59.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I mean, it's really well-made!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.25,0:12:01.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's really freaking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But we have to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Spring CosFest 19 is officially open!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:25.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this tracks...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa is cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But she won't stand out in\Na crowd of this many cosplayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here are my new releases!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you buy a whole set, you get a postcard, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll get the whole set, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.33,0:12:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Here's your set and the bonus postcard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.75,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716.8,453.6)}{\an7}Lady Folosso
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,My, she's going to be your living,\Nbreathing poster, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:53.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll sell out in no time...\NOh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,D-dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,If only they knew how cute she looked as Lillel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:13:00.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Lilliel!\NYou gotta tell everyone what you're selling!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,How are people gonna know what's inside\Nthose blank cases if you don't tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hi, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean talk to a stranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If it were that easy, I wouldn't be an otaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-what is this? A cosrom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.29,0:13:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,A customer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you the cosplayer? You're young.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.54,0:13:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, I'm cosplaying Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel?! What year is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, I dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait... H-hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Selling her cosrom means that other people\Nare gonna see her in all those poses...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I kinda don't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.83,0:13:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's wrong with me?\NThat's the whole thing she wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:50.96,Q13,,0,0,0,,Let me check how much I've got left. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:50.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why am I so uncomfortable with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,There he goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And now I'm relieved!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't right.\NI'm starting to hope we don't sell anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you like this, Okumura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you in this cosrom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, I'm cosplaying Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are there panty shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No! None of them are sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:12.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Crap! Why'd I say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:17.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, it's not an erotic photoshoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're just normal photos, safe for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:24.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is way too expensive, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-thanks anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.33,0:14:30.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, there really aren't any sexy pictures on these?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:34.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course there aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't sell anything softcore,\NI'm under eighteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then what'd we take all those sexy pictures for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:46.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those were all just for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?! Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I mean, I'm still a little too shy to let\Nother people look at those pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm just happy\NI have you as my photographer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:00.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:02.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling relieved again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, am I jealous?!\NWhy am I acting like I'm her boyfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, let's just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna sell anything.\NI don't want to waste your precious time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?\NHow could I want her to fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.29,0:15:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,My my... evacuating the premises already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must be popular to have sold out so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Think about how Ririsa might feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:30.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you're really okay with ending things like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.46,0:15:31.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.71,0:15:32.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go get changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let people see your Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I... I need to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,For a moment, I hoped you wouldn't sell anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:50.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't want someone other than\Nme seeing you dressed as Lilliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's that supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your dream was for everyone to\Nsee your Lilliel cosplay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why you asked me to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I said I'd never judge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is your dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,People need to see your Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-but why would they want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is so much better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:15.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, they're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:24.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Lilliel is the cutest in the entire world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.08,0:16:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That day, our clubroom was graced by an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:30.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Lilliel was so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You made me, the world's biggest Lilliel fan,\Nthink she was real!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:42.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get into Lilliel, and show them you're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:45.75,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,324)}{\an7}Women's\N{\pos(499.2,374.4)}{\an7}Changing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,When does the event end?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, we have to leave at 3:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.50,0:16:53.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then we're almost out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'll change as fast as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:58.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll show everyone you're the best Lilliel ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:16:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:04.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It usually takes her an hour to get into costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:06.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hopefully she can make it in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's enough selfies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-that's the women's changing room!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.71,0:17:17.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Was that chick your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.13,0:17:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We're all girls here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, you are? I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you hear him? "Back off!" He's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Akito!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every cosplayer needs a partner like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.13,0:17:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're so handsome...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:48.71,Q14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780.8,475.2)}{\an7}Little Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go wait in the photo area...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.75,0:17:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The line is getting long,\Nso please form a semicircle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:54.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll take a break in sixty seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things are getting intense over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.00,0:17:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing's doing it for me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.67,0:18:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's all the usuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,My, abandoning your cosplayer\Nto take some photos yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.21,0:18:12.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Milady Magino is the number-one standout today,\Nso please, go right ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shut up! My Lilliel is number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Show ‘em, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wanna get changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen my other sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You wanna do the Vanga\Nconcert outfits for the next event?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be Rei-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,This outfit's dying on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's changing out of their costumes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.63,0:18:42.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's so crowded in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can have my spot, I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:46.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:50.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay! I'm coming, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.21,0:18:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, first, pull up my hair, put on my wig cap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay! Calm down and think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shoot, I forgot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't wear my wig without a wig cap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm missing a whole bunch of stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:16.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's ‘cause I was so distracted this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.29,0:19:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Senpai. I can't be Liliel today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you need a wig cap?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:32.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?! B-but aren't you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.83,0:19:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always carry an extra just\Nin case someone needs one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you forget something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.63,0:19:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got a spare binder, body tape,\Nsafety pins, whatever you need!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is happening right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's her first event!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be Liliel! That takes me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're showing a lot of underboob,\Ndo you need pasties?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:50.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or a stick-on bra?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,All these anime characters want to help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hurry, the event's almost over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.83,0:20:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, the stitchwork is so clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where'd you buy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.17,0:20:06.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:08.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You made that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.29,0:20:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,For your first event? That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:13.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't want everything back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's gotten stuff from\Nother cosplayers at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why we always bring extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.83,0:20:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make sure you return the favor to someone\Nin the future, okay, Liliel-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:27.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:31.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you that girl from a while back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:33.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a softcore event,\Nso come back when you're in high school, mmkay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were with Mayura-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow. So glad you made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Lilliel!\NThe photo space is gonna close soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.54,0:20:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You need something under that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! But the panties are part of the costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.67,0:20:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not when you're under eighteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:58.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have a petticoat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Definitely don't carry extras of those...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:04.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Emergency measures, then.\NI'm leaving, so you can have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure you've got everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:08.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, everyone! I've gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should go get pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:18.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's barely any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.83,0:21:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:20.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanna get pictures with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.67,0:21:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.63,0:21:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, why is Akito-sama in the girls' changing room?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay, I'm a girl. Talk about déjà vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you the girl who's with that guy outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:34.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was pretty worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.67,0:21:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was out there trying to keep you safe from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't blame him,\Nconsidering you're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got yourself a good partner out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.75,0:21:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Probably time for us to head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If that camera of yours is no toy,\Nwhy not take some of milady Magino?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:22:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's Lilliel-chan? Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:24:00.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,388.8)}{\an7}First Event Is Over!!
